WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.300
Meet Ghostty Studio — a local, visual editor for the config you actually use.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.600
Add a background image and preview every change before it touches disk.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.500
Tune visibility, fit, and position with immediate feedback.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:17.800
Then inspect the exact diff, validate it with Ghostty, and save with a restore point.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:22.700
Your comments, ordering, and config sources stay intact.
